Step 2: Instrument withJobLock for lock wait time

In `engine.go` `withJobLock()`, record the time before the lock acquisition loop and observe after acquisition succeeds:
```go
lockStart := time.Now()
// ... lock loop ...
if e.metrics != nil {
    e.metrics.ObserveJobLockWait(time.Since(lockStart).Seconds())
}
```

Step 4: Track active goroutines in HandlePacket

In `engine.go` `HandlePacket()`, after the stopped check, increment active goroutines gauge and defer decrement:
```go
if e.metrics != nil {
    e.metrics.SetActiveGoroutines(1)  // or use Inc/Dec pattern
}
defer func() {
    if e.metrics != nil {
        e.metrics.SetActiveGoroutines(-1)
    }
}()
```
Note: Consider using `IncActiveGoroutines`/`DecActiveGoroutines` instead of Set for atomicity.
